  "blocks": [
   {
    "id": "p1",
    "type": "paragraph",
    "content": [
     {
      "t": "text",
      "v": "Nenad Bach is a "
     },
     {
      "t": "gloss",
      "v": "Croatian-American",
      "zh": "克罗地亚裔美国籍的"
     },
     {
      "t": "text",
      "v": " "
     },
     {
      "t": "gloss",
      "v": "recording",
      "zh": "唱片"
     },
     {
      "t": "text",
      "v": " artist. For decades, he travelled the world, going on tours and "
     },
     {
      "t": "blank",
      "id": "b1",
      "number": 1
     },
     {
      "t": "text",
      "v": " with many famous musicians. His life was "
     },
     {
      "t": "blank",
      "id": "b2",
      "number": 2
     },
     {
      "t": "text",
      "v": " music and excitement."
     }
    ]
   },
   {
    "id": "p2",
    "type": "paragraph",
    "content": [
     {
      "t": "blank",
      "id": "b3",
      "number": 3
     },
     {
      "t": "text",
      "v": ", in 2010, everything stopped suddenly. Nenad was "
     },
     {
      "t": "vocab",
      "v": "diagnosed",
      "ref": "v-diagnose"
     },
     {
      "t": "text",
      "v": " with "
     },
     {
      "t": "gloss",
      "v": "Parkinson’s disease",
      "zh": "帕金森病"
     },
     {
      "t": "text",
      "v": ". This is a kind of "
     },
     {
      "t": "gloss",
      "v": "nervous system disorder",
      "zh": "神经系统紊乱"
     },
     {
      "t": "text",
      "v": ". It can make it "
     },
     {
      "t": "blank",
      "id": "b4",
      "number": 4
     },
     {
      "t": "text",
      "v": " for a person to move. The condition also gets "
     },
     {
      "t": "blank",
      "id": "b5",
      "number": 5
     },
     {
      "t": "text",
      "v": " as time goes by. Nenad shared, “Five years after I was diagnosed, I couldn’t even play a single "
     },
     {
      "t": "gloss",
      "v": "chord",
      "zh": "和弦"
     },
     {
      "t": "text",
      "v": " on my guitar.” He felt very sad because he could "
     },
     {
      "t": "blank",
      "id": "b6",
      "number": 6
     },
     {
      "t": "text",
      "v": " play his music."
     }
    ]
   },
   {
    "id": "p3",
    "type": "paragraph",
    "content": [
     {
      "t": "text",
      "v": "Then, one day, a friend asked Nenad to play ping pong. Nenad decided to try. He discovered that he really liked the game. More importantly, the next day, he woke up feeling a strong “"
     },
     {
      "t": "vocab",
      "v": "desire",
      "ref": "v-desire"
     },
     {
      "t": "text",
      "v": " to live”. After that, he kept playing ping pong "
     },
     {
      "t": "blank",
      "id": "b7",
      "number": 7
     },
     {
      "t": "text",
      "v": ". Because of playing ping pong, Nenad started to feel healthier and much happier."
     }
    ]
   },
   {
    "id": "p4",
    "type": "paragraph",
    "content": [
     {
      "t": "text",
      "v": "In 2017, Nenad started a "
     },
     {
      "t": "vocab",
      "v": "nonprofit organization",
      "ref": "v-nonprofit-organization"
     },
     {
      "t": "text",
      "v": " called Ping Pong Parkinson. The "
     },
     {
      "t": "blank",
      "id": "b8",
      "number": 8
     },
     {
      "t": "text",
      "v": " of this group is to encourage people with Parkinson’s and teach them how to play ping pong. Now, Nenad has a new "
     },
     {
      "t": "vocab",
      "v": "mission",
      "ref": "v-mission"
     },
     {
      "t": "text",
      "v": " in life: to share the "
     },
     {
      "t": "blank",
      "id": "b9",
      "number": 9
     },
     {
      "t": "text",
      "v": " of this sport. He "
     },
     {
      "t": "blank",
      "id": "b10",
      "number": 10
     },
     {
      "t": "text",
      "v": " hopes that others with Parkinson’s can "
     },
     {
      "t": "vocab",
      "v": "benefit from",
      "ref": "v-benefit-from"
     },
     {
      "t": "text",
      "v": " playing ping pong, just like he did."
     }
    ]
   }
  ]
 },
